2:["$","div",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article_main__1Pn1m","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article_container__wzjwn","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/blog/an-anthology-2","className":"article_breadcrumb___c84r","children":"An Anthology of Joy and Thought Vol. 2"}],["$","$La",null,{"className":"article_image___Nqy_","src":"/blog/an-anthology-2/2.jpg","width":600,"height":600,"alt":"article image"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article_credit___6j_R","children":"Image: Stephen Noh"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"article_title__N4vEA","children":"lighthouse"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article_text__pQeGk","children":["The rain crashes ",["$","br",null,{}],"The thunder roars ",["$","br",null,{}],"The wind bellows ",["$","br",null,{}],"My ship turns at each crashing wave ",["$","br",null,{}],"In a seemingly never-ending storm, i am ready to sink ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"I've lost my hope",["$","br",null,{}],"I've lost my direction ",["$","br",null,{}],"There is nowhere else for me to belong ",["$","br",null,{}],"Lost at sea, in this storm, i sit alone ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"I ready myself to lose it all ",["$","br",null,{}],"But in the distance a light appears ",["$","br",null,{}],"A beacon of hope ",["$","br",null,{}],"A ray of solace ",["$","br",null,{}],"And in the midst of the storm, i see You ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"The same God who created these waters ",["$","br",null,{}],"The same God who created these roaring clouds ",["$","br",null,{}],"The same God who calms the winds ",["$","br",null,{}],"You are the lamp unto my feet ",["$","br",null,{}],"MY light in the darkness ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"So guide me ",["$","br",null,{}],"Shine brighter than anything else in this storm ",["$","br",null,{}],"Pull me closer to You ",["$","br",null,{}],"And as I take these steps in these rushing waters ",["$","br",null,{}],"Remind me ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","q",null,{"children":"I am always with You."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article_buttons__87qfW","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/blog/an-anthology-2/1","className":"article_href__yOLmS","children":"<  Previous"}],["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/blog/an-anthology-2/3","className":"article_href__yOLmS","children":"Next  >"}]]}]]}]}]}]
